 🏛️ NEW this morning: Rep. Robert Garcia (D-Calif.), incoming chair of the House Oversight Committee, is laying the groundwork for a wave of investigations into President Trump's inner circle, sending document-retention letters to Vice President Vance , Don Jr. , Eric Trump , Jared Kushner , Kimberly Guilfoyle , Stephen Miller , Susie Wiles , Kristi Noem , Corey Lewandowski , Attorney General Todd Blanche and more. Go deeper . 

 🇨🇳 Breaking: President Trump landed in Shenzhen, China, today, seeking to reinforce the U.S. status as the world's leading technology power. Xi paid Trump a special honor by greeting him on the tarmac, reciprocating a gesture by Trump during Xi's state visit to Washington in September. Get the latest . 

 
 
